    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUST FIND BEANS is a fast-paced first person shooter set following the realization that you\u2019re all out of beans. The problem is, you\u2019re nearing the end of cooking all the other items and you can\u2019t just not have them. Without beans, the day just won\u2019t be started off right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many will try to stop you as you race out in search of the final piece of your meal. But you must not let them. Find a can of beans by any means necessary before everything else you began cooking burns.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUST FIND BEANS is a fast-paced first person shooter set following the realization that you\u2019re all out of beans. The problem is, you\u2019re nearing the end of cooking all the other items and you can\u2019t just not have them. Without beans, the day just won\u2019t be started off right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many will try to stop you as you race out in search of the final piece of your meal. But you must not let them. Find a can of beans by any means necessary before everything else you began cooking burns.</p>",
